 ## Background
-Uniform sampling was introduced as the baseline sampling method in the original NeRF paper [16] (cited as [S1] in the context of NerfAcc). It assumes a constant PDF and linearly decaying transmittance, which is inherent to coarse-level NeRF models [S1]. It is widely used in neural radiance field implementations due to its simplicity [S1, S11].
